{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"gloss-detail","href":"/shijing/gloss/077-shu-yu-tian/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/gloss/077-shu-yu-tian/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 叔于田，巷無居人。豈無居人？不如叔也，洵美且仁。叔于狩，巷無飲酒。豈無飲酒？不如叔也，洵美且好。叔適野，巷無服馬。豈無服馬？不如叔也，洵美且武。 · 方玉润 · 总评","description":"風 · 鄭風 · 叔于田 · 《诗经原始(上下)》关于“叔于田，巷無居人。豈無居人？不如叔也，洵美且仁。…”的注脚：方玉润论《叔于田》确是刺庄公之诗，认为诗不必直斥庄公，只极写叔段游猎无度、饮酒服马，便足见其恃宠而骄，而所谓“美且仁”“美且好”“美且武”乃是故…"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"077-shu-yu-tian","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi","glossId":"0001-1"},"href":"/shijing/gloss/077-shu-yu-tian/fangyurun-yuanshi/0001-1","poem":{"id":"077-shu-yu-tian","title":"叔于田","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"zhengfeng","path":["風","鄭風","叔于田"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"叔于田","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-002","text":"巷無居人","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-003","text":"豈無居人","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-004","text":"不如叔也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-005","text":"洵美且仁","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-006","text":"叔于狩","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-007","text":"巷無飲酒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-008","text":"豈無飲酒","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-009","text":"不如叔也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-010","text":"洵美且好","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-011","text":"叔適野","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-012","text":"巷無服馬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-013","text":"豈無服馬","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-014","text":"不如叔也","isActive":true},{"id":"seg-015","text":"洵美且武","isActive":true}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"annotation":{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":1,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"叔于田，巷無居人。豈無居人？不如叔也，洵美且仁。叔于狩，巷無飲酒。豈無飲酒？不如叔也，洵美且好。叔適野，巷無服馬。豈無服馬？不如叔也，洵美且武。","targetNotes":"全篇总评、集释与标韵。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item OEBPS/Text/chapter05_0001_0013.html。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评","text":"方玉润论《叔